client onboarding checklist
  workstation: $WORKSTATION_ADMIN_USER@$WORKSTATION_HOSTNAME
  client:      $client

== Create / baseline ==
[ ] Create the Linux user if missing:
    work user-create $client

[ ] Install or refresh the client-local profile:
