== Compliance decisions ==
[ ] If this client requires endpoint/DNS/AV/encryption compliance, configure it
    as client-specific host-local state and validate with:
    sudo ~/.local/bin/work compliance-doctor $client

[ ] Wazuh/syscheck, when used for a client-specific profile, must include only
    /home/$client and must not scan /home, /home/$WORKSTATION_ADMIN_USER, /etc, /usr, /bin,
    /sbin, or /boot.

== Secrets and keys ==
